&lt;li&gt;Dive Deep into Data: Review and compare client data across spreadsheets and platforms to identify inconsistencies or gaps&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document and Log: Thoroughly document and log all your findings in a clear, standardized format&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate: Work closely with Project Leads who will guide your research and analysis and act as the main point of contact for our clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Multiple Projects: Prioritize and context-switch effectively to complete simultaneous projects; seeing each through to the finish line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement AI-driven automation and LLM integrations to streamline implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
