&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills with a focus on accuracy and consistency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and as part of a collaborative team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with spreadsheets (e.g., Excel), internal tools, and web-based platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with financial data is a plus, but not required. Quick to learn new systems and follow structured processes for data navigation and validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective time management skills and the ability to balance multiple priorities&lt;/li&gt;
