&lt;p&gt;We do expect you to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have acquired a bachelor’s or master’s degree with outstanding results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a UK work permit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a natural ability to make people feel comfortable around you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of everything you do, be proactive and follow through on commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to get to know other people and learn, develop, and push yourself.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No experience is needed. If need be, we will teach you everything you need to know about recruiting.&lt;/li&gt;
