&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client Relationship Management
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain long-term relationships with key collectors, buyers, consignors, advisors and industry contacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own relationships with strategic clients and market participants within Handbags, developing tailored approaches to drive acquisition, retention and transaction activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver a highly personalised and consultative client experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to clients by providing market insight, collecting expertise and transaction guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
