&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Werkstudent/in im Rezeptmanagement unterstützt du unser Rezeptentwicklungsteam bei der Pflege und Verwaltung kulinarischer Daten. Dabei arbeitest du eng mit dem Culinary-Operations-Team zusammen und sorgst mit einem guten Blick fürs Detail, Struktur und Sorgfalt dafür, dass Rezepturen korrekt abgebildet und unsere Datensätze zuverlässig gepflegt sind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte beachte, dass diese Stelle zunächst auf 12 Monate befristet ist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Verantwortungsbereich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rezept-Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Pflege und Aktualisierung von Rezeptdaten in unseren internen Systemen sowie kurzfristige Anpassung von Rezepten bei Änderungen von Zutaten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Korrekturlesen:&lt;/strong&gt; Prüfung von Rezepten auf korrekte Datenpunkte, Vollständigkeit und Konsistenz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rezept-Optimierung:&lt;/strong&gt; Erstellung und Überprüfung anpassbarer Rezeptvarianten auf Basis bestehender Rezepte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Datenkontrolle:&lt;/strong&gt; Regelmäßige Validierung der Einträge in unserem System sowie systematische Fehleranalyse und -behebung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance-Analyse: &lt;/strong&gt;Unterstützung bei der Auswertung von Rezepten auf Basis von Kundenfeedback sowie Zusammenfassung neuer Erkenntnisse und wiederkehrender Muster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Studium mit Bezug zu Ernährung, Daten, Naturwissenschaften oder Wirtschaft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Begeisterung für die Themen Essen und Kochen sowie grundlegendes kulinarisches Verständnis (z. B. Garzeiten, Geschmacksprofile, Zutatenkunde), welches eine fachliche Beurteilung bzw. Bearbeitung von Rezepten ermöglicht - auch ohne selbst am Herd zu stehen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailverliebtheit, Zuverlässigkeit und ein selbstständiger Arbeitsstil, kombiniert mit Freude an klaren Strukturen und sorgfältiger Datenpflege&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lösungsorientiertes Denken und die Fähigkeit, logisch nachvollziehbare Alternativen selbstständig zu entwickeln&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fließende Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse (jeweils mind. auf C1-Niveau)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen Wohlfühlarbeitsplatz &lt;/strong&gt;mit einem tollen Team&amp;nbsp;in Berlin-Kreuzberg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rabatte&lt;/strong&gt; auf unsere HelloFresh Kochboxen und Convini-Produkte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weiterentwicklungsmöglichkeiten&lt;/strong&gt; durch interne Trainings sowie ein jährliches Team-Budget für Weiterbildung &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(NICHT FÜR PRAKTIKANTEN)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein flexibles Arbeitsumfeld&lt;/strong&gt; mit Vertrauensarbeitszeit &amp;amp; Work From Home/Work From Abroad Policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt; inkl. Buddy-Programm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spaß&lt;/strong&gt; bei Teamevents, Friday Beers, Company Runs, Buchclub u.v.m.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergünstigte Fitnessangebote&lt;/strong&gt; bei Urban Sports Club bzw. John Reed, regelmäßige Yoga-Sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initiativen für das Wohlbefinden&lt;/strong&gt; durch Kooperationen mit der Headspace-App und Spill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Einen monatlichen Zuschuss zum Deutschlandticket&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bist du die fehlende Zutat?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Wenn diese Gelegenheit für Dich lecker klingt, freuen wir uns darauf, von Dir zu hören. Wir bemühen uns, Dein Profil zu prüfen und Dir innerhalb von 5 Werktagen zu antworten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1002&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Supply Chain planning working student for 12 months at the heart of our Product team, where you will be responsible for supporting our operational and strategic needs for our physical product: meal kits. You will be central to our activity and will have a significant influence on our customers&#39; meals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone capable of assisting us in the operational planning of recipes at HelloFresh. This is a unique opportunity to learn and gain experience within a fast-growing company that is pioneering the food industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to be a driving force in the growth of a scale-up, then this position is for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your area of responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Menu creation and optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;Assist the team in creating and optimizing menus using our python-based menu-planning algorithm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; You will work on several projects and initiatives that focus on improving our product offering aiming to increase customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Menu De-Risking:&lt;/strong&gt; You will lead a number of cross-collaborative initiatives and processes aiming to reduce the menu risk and to ensure ingredient availability by considering the end-to-end value chain of our product.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations support:&lt;/strong&gt; You support the team in day-to-day operations as well as with administrative and organizational tasks along the supply and menu planning process and have the opportunity to solve concrete problems, make decisions, and learn to manage real-world situations in a dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process management:&lt;/strong&gt; You will participate in projects aimed at optimizing and automating and improving our product processes and supply chain by working with other teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; You will track the weekly performance of menus and recipes, and conduct analyses on their monthly/quarterly performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recipe change management in menus:&lt;/strong&gt; You will select alternative recipes when needed (ingredient shortage, marketing need, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recipe &amp;amp; Ingredient Pool management:&lt;/strong&gt; You will contribute to the maintenance of the recipe and ingredient database in alignment with the culinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customization: &lt;/strong&gt;You will support the expansion of our product offering by uploading and managing customized menu options to provide customers with greater choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are completing a degree in Business Administration, Management, Industrial Engineering, or a related discipline, ideally with a focus on Product Management, Supply Chain or Operations Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial experience in product management or supply planning, CPG and E-Commerce experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent command of Excel; knowledge of SQL and Python is a real plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-on mindset and team spirit, which is very important as you will be working with many different people and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English, German is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills, rigor, and great attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive and ambitious mindset, with a desire to be part of a particularly dynamic business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm for the world of food and an interest in data are real assets for this job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern and comfortable working space&lt;/strong&gt; with great co-workers in Berlin-Kreuzberg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discount&lt;/strong&gt; for HelloFresh boxes and Convini products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extensive Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt; and Buddy Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social events&lt;/strong&gt; including team events, Friday beers, company runs, book club, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discounted fitness offers&lt;/strong&gt; with our Urban Sports Club and John Reed partners, as well as yoga classes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Well-being initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; in cooperation with Headspace and Spill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monthly allowance for the Deutschlandticket&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1001&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a dynamic, hands-on Senior Product Delivery Manager at HelloFresh. This role is pivotal to the future of our fulfillment network. You will be at the helm of further developing and deploying a high-profile, highly complex strategic project that fundamentally redefines our production methods and capabilities across our DCs.&lt;br&gt;Working closely with Tech and Operations Leadership, you will be responsible for taking our new, next-generation production setup and refining its processes, equipment, and layouts. Once optimized, you will lead the charge in deploying this new operational blueprint into other DCs across our international markets.&lt;br&gt;This is not a traditional desk-bound product role; it requires a strong operational background, deep understanding of physical process design, and the ability to bridge the gap between high-level strategy and on-the-ground execution. The international role will be based in our Berlin office and will involve frequent travel to our local warehouses across markets and potentially extended stays during roll-out periods.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process and Equipment Design:&lt;/strong&gt; You will actively design, evaluate, and refine DC layouts, operational workflows, and physical equipment setups for our next-generation production models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Deployment &amp;amp; Rollout:&lt;/strong&gt; Working cross-functionally, you will be the driving force for the end-to-end implementation and deployment of production technologies. Including this complex new production model across multiple international fulfillment centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lean Management &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; You will apply Lean principles to continuously test, tweak, and optimize the operational setup and production capacity before, during, and after site rollouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You will act as the central node between global engineering, local operations teams, tech, and senior leadership. You will manage expectations, align priorities, and ensure smooth execution across a matrixed international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; You will identify, prioritize, structure, and solve an array of complex physical and systematic business problems on the shop floor, using analytics, engineering principles, and strong business judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; You will support the development of rollout strategies and produce the resulting project plans, ensuring that we deploy at scale without disrupting ongoing operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation and Standardization:&lt;/strong&gt; You will drive towards clear and structured project documentation, clearly defining and outlining the solutions, requirements, … You will help us create standard deployment playbooks which speed up bringing our solutions to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a strong track record within a production, manufacturing, or supply chain environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess highly specific, demonstrated experience in DC layout design, process design, and equipment design/optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Methodology: You have deep expertise in Lean Management principles and continuous improvement methodologies within a physical operational setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership: You have exceptional project delivery and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to influence and guide teams in an environment that requires intense cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Academic Record:&lt;/strong&gt; An excellent academic record with a degree from a top-tier college or University (Engineering, Supply Chain, or Business degrees strongly preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience at an (operational / management) consulting firm with a focus on manufacturing/operations projects is a big plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a demonstrated ability to deliver heavy-hitting impact and work highly independently in an unstructured, fast-moving, and constantly evolving high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobility:&lt;/strong&gt; You have an interest and willingness to frequently travel abroad (~50%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with a German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#PRODUCT #OPERATIONS&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The (Senior) Category Manager Marketing will be responsible for overseeing strategic sourcing and contracting at HelloFresh for Marketing across different marketing categories, which may include: Offline Media, Online Media, Influencer Marketing, Sponsorships, Retail Media, etc. The goal is to collaborate seamlessly with Global and regional stakeholders and major suppliers in all HelloFresh markets and help them to navigate the procurement landscape. In addition, the role will be supporting initiatives targeted to increase the maturity level of Indirect Procurement’s processes and systems landscape. As part of the Marketing&amp;nbsp; Procurement team the position will report to the respective lead based in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an entrepreneurial, confident, proactive and high-spirited Procurement professional with a strength for prioritisation, data handling and great stakeholder management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will make HelloFresh better. We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end Marketing sourcing: supplier market mapping, RFx execution, negotiation, and contract award for high-value projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop category strategies for different marketing categories, in alignment with the business’ goals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, align and execute a sourcing roadmap with key stakeholders in the HQ and the regional markets to deliver P&amp;amp;L savings and overall procurement value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and optimize the supplier portfolio across Hello Fresh’s markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate and manage close relationships with (senior) business partners within Marketing to support their objectives and the company growth agenda&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the implementation of best-in-class procurement processes and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5+ years experience in Marketing procurement or in Marketing with a commercial focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of strategic sourcing methodology, category management, and supplier management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills, attention to detail, and drive to working independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of taking ownership: identifying problems early and driving resolution independently, without waiting to be directed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including preparing and delivering presentations and reports for senior audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills with proven ability to build trust and credibility with business partners at different levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work in a fast-moving entrepreneurial environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent Business English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;The Group Marketing Controller is the primary finance interface for HelloFresh&#39;s global marketing function. The role exists to ensure marketing spend is planned accurately, closed correctly, and reported transparently — bridging the gap between marketing execution and the Group P&amp;amp;L.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Close &amp;amp; Accruals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the month-end close process for marketing cost lines across all markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and validate marketing accruals submitted by local finance teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve booking errors, misclassifications, or missing accruals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clean actuals in the income statement for all marketing line items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with SE Finance Controlling to improve and create transparency to the markets on marketing IC charges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Budget &amp;amp; Forecast Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consolidate and challenge market-level marketing budgets during planning cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead marketing Guidance creation for Business Plan cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the Group marketing budget with actuals vs. budget vs. forecast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag material variances early and escalate to marketing stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Reporting &amp;amp; Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Tech and local markets to improve and automate input quality of weekly reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce monthly marketing performance reports covering spend vs. budget, phasing, and key variance drivers (Leverage A.I. and Databricks Dashboards)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the CFO/board reporting pack with accurate marketing cost commentary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain performance reports for Global Marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Business Partnering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the day-to-day finance contact for the Global Marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Direct and Indirect spend for the Marketing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Process &amp;amp; Controls&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document and improve the end-to-end marketing close process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistent cost treatment across markets (e.g. working vs. non-working spend, agency fees, media)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify gaps in how marketing costs are captured and propose fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT SUCCESS LOOKS LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clean marketing close every month — no material restatements or late accruals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholders can trust the marketing numbers without re-checking them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Variances are explained proactively, not reactively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing controller processes are standardised across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT THE FUTURE LOOKS LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage marketing spend between markets by reviewing ROI, AOR and agreed upon KPI performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Centralised and automated marketing controlling at month-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT THIS ROLE IS NOT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not a marketing strategist — not expected to have opinions on campaign effectiveness or brand direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not a data analyst — analytical support comes from the Finance Systems team; this role translates outputs into financial conclusions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not a local market controller — this role holds the Group view; local controllers own their market execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of experience in financial controlling, FP&amp;amp;A, or a similar finance business-partnering role, ideally with exposure to marketing or performance-marketing cost structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel/Google Sheets skills; comfort working with large datasets and BI/reporting tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to explain financial variances clearly to non-finance stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running or supporting a month-end close process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating across multiple markets and currencies in a fast-paced, matrixed organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about how AI and automation can modernise financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
