&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;The Group Marketing Controller is the primary finance interface for HelloFresh&#39;s global marketing function. The role exists to ensure marketing spend is planned accurately, closed correctly, and reported transparently — bridging the gap between marketing execution and the Group P&amp;amp;L.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Close &amp;amp; Accruals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the month-end close process for marketing cost lines across all markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and validate marketing accruals submitted by local finance teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve booking errors, misclassifications, or missing accruals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clean actuals in the income statement for all marketing line items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with SE Finance Controlling to improve and create transparency to the markets on marketing IC charges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Budget &amp;amp; Forecast Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consolidate and challenge market-level marketing budgets during planning cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead marketing Guidance creation for Business Plan cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the Group marketing budget with actuals vs. budget vs. forecast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag material variances early and escalate to marketing stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Reporting &amp;amp; Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Tech and local markets to improve and automate input quality of weekly reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce monthly marketing performance reports covering spend vs. budget, phasing, and key variance drivers (Leverage A.I. and Databricks Dashboards)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the CFO/board reporting pack with accurate marketing cost commentary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain performance reports for Global Marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Business Partnering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the day-to-day finance contact for the Global Marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Direct and Indirect spend for the Marketing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Process &amp;amp; Controls&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document and improve the end-to-end marketing close process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistent cost treatment across markets (e.g. working vs. non-working spend, agency fees, media)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify gaps in how marketing costs are captured and propose fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT SUCCESS LOOKS LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clean marketing close every month — no material restatements or late accruals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholders can trust the marketing numbers without re-checking them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Variances are explained proactively, not reactively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing controller processes are standardised across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT THE FUTURE LOOKS LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage marketing spend between markets by reviewing ROI, AOR and agreed upon KPI performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Centralised and automated marketing controlling at month-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT THIS ROLE IS NOT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not a marketing strategist — not expected to have opinions on campaign effectiveness or brand direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not a data analyst — analytical support comes from the Finance Systems team; this role translates outputs into financial conclusions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not a local market controller — this role holds the Group view; local controllers own their market execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of experience in financial controlling, FP&amp;amp;A, or a similar finance business-partnering role, ideally with exposure to marketing or performance-marketing cost structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel/Google Sheets skills; comfort working with large datasets and BI/reporting tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to explain financial variances clearly to non-finance stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running or supporting a month-end close process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating across multiple markets and currencies in a fast-paced, matrixed organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about how AI and automation can modernise financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is committed to the principles of equal employment opportunity and providing reasonable accommodations to candidates with disabilities. If you need an accommodation during the application process, please reach out to us at:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Europe: ----- ----- States: ----- -----Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Mission Optimization team is responsible for continuously improving the operations and productivity of the world’s largest Earth observation satellite constellation. We identify, triage, and resolve the bottlenecks that limit what our fleets can deliver – from contact scheduling and downlink latency, to collection capacity, to concepts of operation for our future missions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Space Systems Engineer on this team you will own the definition of novel concepts of operations. You will take problems that begin as a customer commitment, a contractual obligation, or an unexploited spacecraft capability, and turn them into an operational concept that engineering teams can build and operators can run.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will operate with substantial latitude, working closely with spacecraft and systems engineering groups to understand what current and future fleets are capable of, with the software and operations teams who build and run the systems you&#39;re changing, and with Product and customer-facing teams to stay anchored to commitments and SLA risk. Being effective across those boundaries is a core part of this job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; This is a full-time, hybrid role which will require you to work from our Berlin office 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and own concepts of operations for new missions, new spacecraft capabilities, and new customer products, from early design through nominal operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead optimization initiatives that span multiple organizations – setting the technical direction, building agreement, and holding the outcome against fleet SLAs and KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a primary technical interface for the team with stakeholders across engineering, operations, and product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate contractual and customer obligations into operational concepts and capacity commitments the fleet can actually meet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model and analyze fleet performance with operational data to identify where capacity, latency, or agility are being left on the table&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain the software solutions that implement these concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a recognized subject-matter expert across Planet and provide technical mentorship within the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant experience in spacecraft operations, mission systems engineering, or a closely related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Aerospace Engineering, Systems Engineering, Computer Science, or a related technical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of concepts of operations for complex operational systems, from definition to implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in Python or a comparable language, ability to model systems, analyze operational data, and contribute production code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantitative approach, including statistical analysis and reasoning over large operational datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading technical initiatives across organizational boundaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate and negotiate technical positions with senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring or technically leading other engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating or designing operations for a large-scale satellite constellation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in optimization, scheduling, or operations research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking a new mission from design through commissioning and nominal operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with commercial Earth Observation, tasking, or fulfillment systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a customer- or partner-facing technical role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with orbital mechanics, link budgets, and spacecraft resource modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DevOps tooling and practices (Git, GitLab, Docker, CI/CD, Linux, Sentry, Datadog)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11:45p / 23:45 CET on the date stated below. Applications are reviewed on a rolling basis. This posting may be removed earlier than projected if a suitable pool of applications has been received. For this reason, we recommend applying as soon as you are able to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Planet Labs Germany GmbH is authorized to receive U.S. export-controlled information at Planet under an export license issued by the Bureau of Industry and Security. This position requires access to U.S. and German/EU export-controlled information, and as such, employment (or hiring of a contractor) is contingent upon the candidate’s ability to access all applicable export-controlled information without additional export licensing being required by German, EU, or U.S. authorities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits While Working at Planet:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These offerings are dependent on employment type and geographical location, based upon applicable law or company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off including vacation, holidays and company-wide days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Wellness Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Phone and Internet Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement and access to LinkedIn Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected starting gross salary range for this role is listed below. Individual placement within this range is determined objectively based on gender-neutral criteria such as your skills, qualifications, and professional experience. This position may also be eligible for discretionary bonuses and/or equity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Germany Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€86.600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.300 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we care so much about Belonging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re dedicated to helping the whole Planet, and to do that we must strive to represent all of it within each of our offices and on all of our teams. That’s why Planet is guided by an ultimate north star of Belonging—dreaming big as we approach our ongoing work.&amp;nbsp; If this job intrigues you, but you’re thinking you might not have all the qualifications, please... do apply!&amp;nbsp; At Planet, we are looking for well-rounded people from around the world who can contribute to more ways than just what is listed in this job description.&amp;nbsp; We don’t just fill positions, we aspire to fulfill people’s careers, most excited about folks who are motivated by our underlying humanitarian efforts.&amp;nbsp; We are a few orbits around the sun before we get to where we want to be, so we hope you’re excited to come along for the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO statement: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is committed to building a community where everyone belongs and we invite people from all backgrounds to apply. Planet is an equal opportunity employer, and committed to providing employment opportunities regardless of race, religious creed, color, national origin, ancestry, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, childbirth and breastfeeding, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other protected classification, in accordance with applicable federal, state, and local laws. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is an inclusive community and we know that everyone has their own needs. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation during the hiring process, please reach out to ----- or contact your recruiter with your request. Your message will be confidential and we will be happy to assist you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/#california&quot;&gt;Planet Data Privacy Notice for California Staff Members and Applicants&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy (European Applicants):&lt;/strong&gt; By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice GDPR Planet Labs Europe&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Our Interviewing Process&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet is committed to providing an exceptional interview experience for all candidates. We currently use &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.metaview.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Metaview&lt;/a&gt; to better focus on candidates and less on trying to capture notes. As such, with the candidate&#39;s consent, select interviews may be recorded and include a &quot;Planet AI Notetaker&quot; for transcription and summarization purposes. Should an interview involve use of AI interview technologies, the candidate will receive notification and have the ability to opt out both in advance and/or real-time. Opting out will not affect one&#39;s candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate AI Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet embraces Artificial Intelligence (AI) tools, and we encourage its responsible use. We understand that candidates may use various resources, including AI tools, to &lt;em&gt;prepare&lt;/em&gt; for interviews and assessments. However, &lt;em&gt;during any live interview stage or when actively completing assessments for this position, the use of AI tools—e.g. Large Language Models (LLMs), deep fake technology, etc.—is strictly prohibited unless explicitly prompted by an interviewer or assessment instructions&lt;/em&gt;. If you are unsure about acceptable use, please contact your recruiter for clarification. If an AI tool or similar technology is desired as an accommodation, please contact ----- with your request for assistance. Your message will be confidential, and we will be happy to assist you. Violation of this policy may result in disqualification of your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Engineering Program Manager (EPM) at Planet you will sit at the intersection of our hardware, engineering, and external partnerships to drive complex spacecraft programs from inception to launch. You will help set strategy, drive problem-solving efforts, eliminate roadblocks, execute on schedule, and you will be responsible for managing and communicating status and issues along the way. The ideal candidate has deep technical expertise and experience in multiple areas of spacecraft design and manufacturing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, in-office position based in our Berlin manufacturing hub 5 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead satellite development programs from planning and requirements definition through critical design, build, test, and launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure efficient execution of all program phases, including MCR, SRR, PDR, CDR, IRR, SRR, and LRR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop project schedules and budgets and track performance across all project phases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee execution of technical plans at all levels, both internally and with external suppliers, including project definition, budgeting, and long-term strategic planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate and coordinate with external stakeholders, including suppliers, partners, vendors, and customers, to manage deliverables, technical plans, and program milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate schedules, priorities, and status updates with engineering, manufacturing, teams, stakeholders, and management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with multiple engineering teams and cross-functional stakeholders to drive productivity and progress on concurrent projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop tools and processes to measure and improve engineering productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive root cause problem-solving, identify, and eliminate blocking issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with Program Management, Manufacturing Operations, Supply Chain to drive progress on concurrent manufacturing lines and initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead manufacturing ramp programs from early factory engagement and readiness through key build phases into production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive root cause analysis for complex engineering and manufacturing issues, identify and eliminate blocking problems, and implement robust corrective actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant experience of program management in aerospace, manufacturing or similar industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Aerospace Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Manufacturing Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication and facilitation skills, including externally to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in spoken and written German and professional working proficiency in English, the language of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in an engineering program management role for the development and ramp of hardware systems in a cross-functional context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capability to exercise creative and critical thinking in project execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with and managing external contract manufacturers (CMs), suppliers, and vendors to drive program success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication and facilitation skills, with the ability to present complex technical information clearly to diverse audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel internationally, specifically to San Francisco about 2-3 times a year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with satellite manufacturing and AI&amp;amp;T.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with customer management on satellite programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving, organizational, and analytical skills, with the ability to drive strategy based on data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11:45p / 23:45 CET on the date stated below. Applications are reviewed on a rolling basis. This posting may be removed earlier than projected if a suitable pool of applications has been received. For this reason, we recommend applying as soon as you are able to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Planet Labs Germany GmbH is authorized to receive U.S. export-controlled information at Planet under an export license issued by the Bureau of Industry and Security. This position requires access to U.S. and German/EU export-controlled information, and as such, employment (or hiring of a contractor) is contingent upon the candidate’s ability to access all applicable export-controlled information without additional export licensing being required by German, EU, or U.S. authorities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits While Working at Planet:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These offerings are dependent on employment type and geographical location, based upon applicable law or company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off including vacation, holidays and company-wide days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Wellness Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Phone and Internet Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement and access to LinkedIn Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected starting gross salary range for this role is listed below. Individual placement within this range is determined objectively based on gender-neutral criteria such as your skills, qualifications, and professional experience. This position may also be eligible for discretionary bonuses and/or equity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Germany Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€86.600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.300 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we care so much about Belonging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re dedicated to helping the whole Planet, and to do that we must strive to represent all of it within each of our offices and on all of our teams. That’s why Planet is guided by an ultimate north star of Belonging—dreaming big as we approach our ongoing work.&amp;nbsp; If this job intrigues you, but you’re thinking you might not have all the qualifications, please... do apply!&amp;nbsp; At Planet, we are looking for well-rounded people from around the world who can contribute to more ways than just what is listed in this job description.&amp;nbsp; We don’t just fill positions, we aspire to fulfill people’s careers, most excited about folks who are motivated by our underlying humanitarian efforts.&amp;nbsp; We are a few orbits around the sun before we get to where we want to be, so we hope you’re excited to come along for the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO statement: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is committed to building a community where everyone belongs and we invite people from all backgrounds to apply. Planet is an equal opportunity employer, and committed to providing employment opportunities regardless of race, religious creed, color, national origin, ancestry, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, childbirth and breastfeeding, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other protected classification, in accordance with applicable federal, state, and local laws. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is an inclusive community and we know that everyone has their own needs. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation during the hiring process, please reach out to ----- or contact your recruiter with your request. Your message will be confidential and we will be happy to assist you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/#california&quot;&gt;Planet Data Privacy Notice for California Staff Members and Applicants&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy (European Applicants):&lt;/strong&gt; By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice GDPR Planet Labs Europe&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Our Interviewing Process&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet is committed to providing an exceptional interview experience for all candidates. We currently use &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.metaview.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Metaview&lt;/a&gt; to better focus on candidates and less on trying to capture notes. As such, with the candidate&#39;s consent, select interviews may be recorded and include a &quot;Planet AI Notetaker&quot; for transcription and summarization purposes. Should an interview involve use of AI interview technologies, the candidate will receive notification and have the ability to opt out both in advance and/or real-time. Opting out will not affect one&#39;s candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate AI Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet embraces Artificial Intelligence (AI) tools, and we encourage its responsible use. We understand that candidates may use various resources, including AI tools, to &lt;em&gt;prepare&lt;/em&gt; for interviews and assessments. However, &lt;em&gt;during any live interview stage or when actively completing assessments for this position, the use of AI tools—e.g. Large Language Models (LLMs), deep fake technology, etc.—is strictly prohibited unless explicitly prompted by an interviewer or assessment instructions&lt;/em&gt;. If you are unsure about acceptable use, please contact your recruiter for clarification. If an AI tool or similar technology is desired as an accommodation, please contact ----- with your request for assistance. Your message will be confidential, and we will be happy to assist you. Violation of this policy may result in disqualification of your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Wolt, keeping courier supply healthy across every city we operate in is core to a great experience for both customers and couriers. As we&#39;ve scaled to dozens of countries and hundreds of cities, planning supply has grown from a market-by-market exercise into a global challenge: we need a system that plans well everywhere at once – from our largest metros to our smallest cities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s where this role comes in. As Senior Specialist, Global Market Planning, you&#39;ll help refine the models and tools that sit at the heart of how we plan courier supply globally. You&#39;ll work on making sure the right supply levers are pulled in the right markets to hit our goals, help allocate those levers across markets, and dig into problem areas to find and fix root causes. It&#39;s a role at the crossroads of data, tooling, and operations – one for someone who&#39;s as comfortable building a model as they are diving into why a specific market is off plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of the Global Market Planning team and will partner closely with local operations &amp;amp; courier marketing so that our planning always reflects the reality on the ground.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop the global planning model:&lt;/strong&gt; Help develop and refine our global supply planning model so it delivers robust coverage across both large and small cities, accounting for local context like holidays, special events, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop tools that ensure the correct supply levers are being used effectively across markets to hit our targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allocate levers across markets:&lt;/strong&gt; Own within-market supply lever allocation – translating high-level market planning into concrete, market-specific plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep dive &amp;amp; solve:&lt;/strong&gt; Investigate problem areas, identify root causes, and turn your findings into corrective actions and better planning approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with regional supply leads, local operations teams, and central teams (finance, procurement, product, analytics) on plans, performance, and improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve how we work:&lt;/strong&gt; Test and prove new concepts in planning, acquisition, onboarding, and activation, and support the roll-out of global improvements across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience in operations, analytics, or strategic business development in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and modelling skills, with a structured, pragmatic approach to solving complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Looker, SQL, and Excel/Google Sheets modelling is a must; other relevant analytical tools are a plus, including Python, Cursor, and Claude Code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An attitude for action and ownership beyond the obvious – always looking for opportunities to improve, with the determination to drive change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work across cross-functional teams and manage relationships with stakeholders&amp;nbsp; – both local and global.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A true culture champion – someone who leads by example with collaboration, teamwork, and data-driven decision making, and who brings humility and respect to every interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and oral communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are located in either Berlin or Helsinki with the ability to work in a hybrid model from our Wolt office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What to expect from our hiring process:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent Acquisition screen — an introductory conversation with our recruiter to learn more about your background and answer any initial questions about the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring Manager interview — a deeper conversation with the team manager about your experience, the team, and what this role involves day to day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assignment — a practical task related to the role, giving you a chance to show how you approach real problems in this space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final interview — a conversation with a senior stakeholder to round out the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are excited about working in a high-growth environment, taking ownership and being part of an extremely ambitious team, then click below to apply and get the conversation going!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will be reviewing applications on an ongoing basis, so if this sounds like an opportunity you want to pursue, apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please submit your up-to-date resume in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;jfepdd&quot; data-start=&quot;503&quot; data-end=&quot;516&quot;&gt;Who We Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;518&quot; data-end=&quot;653&quot;&gt;Global Marts builds the technology behind DoorDash&#39;s own grocery and retail operations across DashMart, Wolt Market, and Deliveroo Hop.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;655&quot; data-end=&quot;829&quot;&gt;Our systems decide what products our stores stock, how much inventory to purchase, which vendors to source from, how warehouses execute orders, and what prices customers see.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;831&quot; data-end=&quot;1092&quot;&gt;We build everything from forecasting and replenishment systems to vendor management, warehouse execution, labor scheduling, space optimization, and pricing. Our in-house forecasting platform has replaced third-party solutions and now powers production globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1094&quot; data-end=&quot;1249&quot;&gt;This isn&#39;t a traditional CRUD backend environment. Much of our work involves designing new systems that solve complex operational problems at global scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1094&quot; data-end=&quot;1249&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;11vcmyo&quot; data-start=&quot;1251&quot; data-end=&quot;1268&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1270&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;As a Senior Backend Engineer, you&#39;ll work primarily with Go or Kotlin and take end-to-end ownership of production systems and complex technical initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1428&quot; data-end=&quot;1435&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1437&quot; data-end=&quot;2642&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uw0l5v&quot; data-start=&quot;1437&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;Design, build, and operate backend systems that support inventory, purchasing, warehouse operations, pricing, and fulfillment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1p1pctx&quot; data-start=&quot;1566&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;Own technical solutions from problem definition and design through implementation, deployment, monitoring, and production operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5w2mdo&quot; data-start=&quot;1701&quot; data-end=&quot;1822&quot;&gt;Work on data-heavy systems where software engineering meets forecasting, optimization, and operational decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;91ogko&quot; data-start=&quot;1823&quot; data-end=&quot;1925&quot;&gt;Turn complex and sometimes ambiguous business problems into pragmatic, scalable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10gd5ut&quot; data-start=&quot;1926&quot; data-end=&quot;2057&quot;&gt;Make and influence architectural decisions, balancing scalability, reliability, development speed, and long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1772gwz&quot; data-start=&quot;2058&quot; data-end=&quot;2195&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with engineers, product managers, data scientists, and operations teams to shape solutions and technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12p2fv1&quot; data-start=&quot;2196&quot; data-end=&quot;2301&quot;&gt;Improve the reliability, observability, scalability, and operational excellence of the systems you own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;e71nt1&quot; data-start=&quot;2302&quot; data-end=&quot;2427&quot;&gt;Support and raise the engineering standards of the team through technical discussions, code reviews, and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c0xwgg&quot; data-start=&quot;2428&quot; data-end=&quot;2642&quot;&gt;Use AI-assisted development tools effectively while applying strong engineering judgment to validate their output, improve development velocity, and identify opportunities where AI can create additional leverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;ueh9pi&quot; data-start=&quot;2644&quot; data-end=&quot;2658&quot;&gt;How We Work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2660&quot; data-end=&quot;3300&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1owhgv3&quot; data-start=&quot;2660&quot; data-end=&quot;2806&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2662&quot; data-end=&quot;2687&quot;&gt;Autonomy &amp;amp; Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineers have end-to-end responsibility for their services, from design and implementation to production and on-call.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jubopr&quot; data-start=&quot;2807&quot; data-end=&quot;2995&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2809&quot; data-end=&quot;2827&quot;&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Architecture and technical direction are shaped together. Senior engineers are expected to contribute actively to decisions and help others arrive at strong solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16jtq5s&quot; data-start=&quot;2996&quot; data-end=&quot;3139&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2998&quot; data-end=&quot;3027&quot;&gt;Scalability &amp;amp; Simplicity:&lt;/strong&gt; We value pragmatic solutions that solve today&#39;s problems while providing a sustainable foundation for tomorrow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;83mt93&quot; data-start=&quot;3140&quot; data-end=&quot;3300&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3142&quot; data-end=&quot;3153&quot;&gt;Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; We work closely with Product, Data Science, and Operations, connecting technical decisions directly to real-world retail and operational outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;bii48p&quot; data-start=&quot;3302&quot; data-end=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;Our Tech Stack&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3321&quot; data-end=&quot;3369&quot;&gt;Our primary backend languages are Go and Kotlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3371&quot; data-end=&quot;3508&quot;&gt;We also use Kafka, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis, Snowflake, AWS, Kubernetes, Docker, gRPC, GitHub Actions, and modern cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3510&quot; data-end=&quot;3710&quot;&gt;You don&#39;t need experience with every technology in our stack. We&#39;re more interested in strong backend and distributed systems fundamentals and your ability to learn and make sound technical decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3510&quot; data-end=&quot;3710&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;12dbe07&quot; data-start=&quot;3712&quot; data-end=&quot;3738&quot;&gt;Our Humble Expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3740&quot; data-end=&quot;3772&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for engineers who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3774&quot; data-end=&quot;5131&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pbqzv6&quot; data-start=&quot;3774&quot; data-end=&quot;3861&quot;&gt;Have strong experience designing, building, and operating production backend systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sb6zfr&quot; data-start=&quot;3862&quot; data-end=&quot;3945&quot;&gt;Have professional experience with Go, Kotlin, or another modern backend language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;c6vjeb&quot; data-start=&quot;3946&quot; data-end=&quot;4089&quot;&gt;Have experience owning services end-to-end, including design, implementation, deployment, monitoring, reliability, and production operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;k5m44e&quot; data-start=&quot;4090&quot; data-end=&quot;4260&quot;&gt;Have strong knowledge of backend and distributed systems fundamentals, including APIs, databases, asynchronous processing, failure handling, testing, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;155uv01&quot; data-start=&quot;4261&quot; data-end=&quot;4399&quot;&gt;Are comfortable working with data-heavy systems and technologies such as Kafka, Snowflake, or similar streaming and data infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n38k5t&quot; data-start=&quot;4400&quot; data-end=&quot;4534&quot;&gt;Can navigate ambiguous problems, break them into actionable steps, make appropriate technical trade-offs, and deliver incrementally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bedv3e&quot; data-start=&quot;4535&quot; data-end=&quot;4673&quot;&gt;Can influence technical decisions beyond their immediate tasks and collaborate effectively with engineers and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12pmfcf&quot; data-start=&quot;4674&quot; data-end=&quot;4743&quot;&gt;Communicate technical concepts and decisions clearly and concisely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hsq0s0&quot; data-start=&quot;4744&quot; data-end=&quot;4951&quot;&gt;Use AI-assisted development tools effectively in their everyday engineering workflow while critically evaluating generated solutions and taking full ownership of the resulting code and technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15sx82r&quot; data-start=&quot;4952&quot; data-end=&quot;5131&quot;&gt;Look for opportunities to use AI to improve engineering productivity and solve problems more effectively, while understanding where human engineering judgment remains essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5133&quot; data-end=&quot;5149&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;5133&quot; data-end=&quot;5149&quot;&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5151&quot; data-end=&quot;5204&quot;&gt;Experience in one or more of the following is a plus:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;5206&quot; data-end=&quot;5566&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14gp6b2&quot; data-start=&quot;5206&quot; data-end=&quot;5286&quot;&gt;Forecasting, optimization, scheduling, recommendation, or decisioning systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1zurb9&quot; data-start=&quot;5287&quot; data-end=&quot;5355&quot;&gt;Grocery, retail, logistics, supply chain, or warehouse technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;al0v23&quot; data-start=&quot;5356&quot; data-end=&quot;5432&quot;&gt;ERP, vendor management, procurement, or workforce management integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;eoufu3&quot; data-start=&quot;5433&quot; data-end=&quot;5507&quot;&gt;Replacing third-party or legacy platforms with internally built systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;48it9n&quot; data-start=&quot;5508&quot; data-end=&quot;5566&quot;&gt;High-throughput event-driven or streaming architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;ca302g&quot; data-start=&quot;5568&quot; data-end=&quot;5583&quot;&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5585&quot; data-end=&quot;5786&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll help build the technology that powers DoorDash&#39;s global grocery and retail business, solving complex operational challenges across inventory, forecasting, fulfillment, pricing, and supply chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5788&quot; data-end=&quot;6032&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll have significant ownership over the systems you build and the opportunity to influence technical direction while working closely with experienced engineers, product managers, data scientists, and operations teams across multiple markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;6034&quot; data-end=&quot;6176&quot;&gt;📍 This role is based in our tech hub in Helsinki or Stockholm. We work in distributed teams, but may not be able to support fully remote work or relocation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;6034&quot; data-end=&quot;6176&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;wyiacj&quot; data-start=&quot;6178&quot; data-end=&quot;6191&quot;&gt;Next Steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;6193&quot; data-end=&quot;6309&quot;&gt;We&#39;re reviewing applications on an ongoing basis, so don&#39;t wait to apply. We&#39;ll get back to you as soon as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can read more about our recruitment process&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.wolt.com/en/how-we-hire&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affinidi&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;is a technology company dedicated to changing data ownership for good. We empower businesses and individuals with control and ownership of their data, with a comprehensive approach to managing their holistic identity – accounting for all aspects of their digital footprint while ensuring privacy and security. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s technology enables users to benefit from decentralised digital identity solutions. We believe that everyone has the right to own and control their data, and we are committed to creating a trusted digital credentials ecosystem that empowers businesses and individuals to securely exchange data and services across borders and industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Product Manager (Technical) who wants to help define how trust is built into the next generation of AI systems. At Affinidi, we’re building the Trust Fabric product suite to give AI agents verifiable identity, policy guardrails, and real-time observability, so organisations can move from promising proofs of concept to secure, governed production deployments with confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a role for builders. You’ll work side by side with engineering to turn ambitious ideas into real, high-impact products, fast, iteratively, and with strong product judgment. You’ll take on complex, ambiguous challenges that don’t come with a playbook, bring structure to what matters, and help the team move with clarity, speed, and conviction. You’ll also collaborate with deeply engaged teams and senior leaders in an environment that expects high standards, values ownership, and gives you the chance to shape meaningful products from the ground up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you like combining technical depth, product thinking, and execution, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Shape and deliver solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner closely with engineers to define and refine solutions early, helping move ideas from concept to production in practical, incremental steps while staying close enough to implementation to understand trade-offs and guide decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive focused, outcome-oriented delivery:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Balance user needs, market context, and execution speed while focusing on getting working solutions into users’ hands for validation, then iterate based on feedback and measurable outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work through ambiguity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Take ownership of areas where requirements are not fully defined, structure problems into clear, actionable paths forward, and maintain momentum even as direction continues to evolve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own product direction:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Contribute to product strategy and roadmap definition, align short-term priorities with longer-term platform thinking, and make thoughtful trade-offs that support both delivery and scalability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate across stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work across engineering, design, and go-to-market teams, engage effectively with senior and executive stakeholders, and bring alignment and clarity in environments with diverse perspectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Be developer-obsessed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Understand developer workflows and key pain points, and help improve integration, usability, and the overall product experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Core experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You bring 5+ years of experience in Technical Product Management, a strong technical background that lets you engage deeply with engineering topics, hands-on experience working with APIs, systems, and integrations, and a proven track record of delivering products in close collaboration with engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Technical depth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You are comfortable understanding how systems are designed and operate in practice, able to engage in technical discussions, challenge assumptions, and evaluate trade-offs, and willing to go into detail when needed by reviewing flows, investigating issues, or clarifying implementation approaches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;You take ownership from problem to outcome, are comfortable working with ambiguity and evolving priorities, combine structured thinking with a bias toward action, and can move between big-picture strategy and practical execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; communication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;You communicate effectively across technical and non-technical audiences, are comfortable working with experienced, highly engaged stakeholders, and know how to build alignment and drive decisions forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;/strong&gt;It’s a plus if you have had exposure to identity, distributed systems, or similar domains, and experience in fast-paced, product-led environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll get&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A team that values ownership, quality, and speed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Close collaboration between product and engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hybrid working model in Berlin + flexible hours&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Unlimited vacation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A strong environment to learn, build, and have impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe in hiring different and diverse talent and providing a safe space where everyone can share their views without fear, where differences are celebrated, and where no one is left out. Inclusive cultures are the foundation for collaboration and innovation within our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this position, you confirm that you have read and understood &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;, and consent to the collection, use, and disclosure of your personal data for recruitment purposes, as described in the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affinidi&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;is a technology company dedicated to changing data ownership for good. We empower businesses and individuals with control and ownership of their data, with a comprehensive approach to managing their holistic identity – accounting for all aspects of their digital footprint while ensuring privacy and security. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s technology enables users to benefit from decentralised digital identity solutions. We believe that everyone has the right to own and control their data, and we are committed to creating a trusted digital credentials ecosystem that empowers businesses and individuals to securely exchange data and services across borders and industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Full Stack Engineering Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;with deep expertise in &lt;strong&gt;backend systems (TypeScript, microservices, cloud)&lt;/strong&gt; to lead multiple engineering teams building the &lt;strong&gt;Affinidi Elements &lt;/strong&gt;platform. While you will manage and support teams working across the full stack (backend, frontend, platform infrastructure), your technical depth and demonstrated experience in backend engineering will be crucial in guiding architecture, ensuring quality, and driving technical strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role blends &lt;strong&gt;people leadership&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;technical leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: you will grow high-performing fullstack teams, define best practices across the stack, and remain hands-on in critical technical decisions to ensure our systems are secure, scalable, and performant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work culture at &lt;strong&gt;Affinidi&lt;/strong&gt; is shaped by the following tenets:   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are unapologetically customer-focused &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We invest in cultures and teams to enable high performance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Embraces experimentation and builds fast &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We have the courage to be misunderstood &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We work together to unlock data   &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multiple engineering teams, providing &lt;strong&gt;vision, direction, and coaching&lt;/strong&gt; to managers, staff engineers, and senior ICs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive &lt;strong&gt;engineering execution and on-time delivery&lt;/strong&gt; of secure, performant, and customer-centric systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and contribute to the design and development of &lt;strong&gt;high-scale, high-performance distributed production systems&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, design, and business stakeholders to define and execute the &lt;strong&gt;technology roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and evolve &lt;strong&gt;engineering best practices, delivery processes, and quality standards&lt;/strong&gt; to scale effectively&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and develop engineering leaders, fostering &lt;strong&gt;career growth, leadership depth, and technical excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of &lt;strong&gt;emerging technologies&lt;/strong&gt;, bringing innovative approaches to improve scalability, architecture, and developer experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion &lt;strong&gt;privacy by design&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;security-first principles&lt;/strong&gt;, and high-quality engineering across backend and frontend systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; You will be a great match if you:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading engineering organizations in global, high-growth environments while driving on-time delivery of high-quality systems at scale&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong &lt;strong&gt; leadership skills&lt;/strong&gt;: coaching, mentoring, developing leaders, and fostering high-performing, inclusive teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are skilled at balancing &lt;strong&gt;strategic vision&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;practical execution&lt;/strong&gt;, aligning engineering teams with business outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript/Node.js&lt;/strong&gt;; &lt;strong&gt;Dart &lt;/strong&gt;experience is preferred; familiarity with C#, Go, or similar is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with &lt;strong&gt; React/Next.js&lt;/strong&gt; and/or &lt;strong&gt;Flutter&lt;/strong&gt;, demonstrates solid understanding of modern web and/or mobile development practices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate proven success in &lt;strong&gt;designing, deploying, and scaling microservices&lt;/strong&gt; in cloud environments, specifically, Amazon Web Services (AWS)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for &lt;strong&gt;privacy, security, cryptography&lt;/strong&gt;, and resilient system design; experience with &lt;strong&gt;asynchronous cryptography and identity/authentication domains&lt;/strong&gt; is a strong plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are skilled at balancing &lt;strong&gt;technical leadership&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;people leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, growing teams while staying engaged in critical technical decisions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel at &lt;strong&gt;cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; with product, design, and security stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in &lt;strong&gt;fast-moving startup environments&lt;/strong&gt;, building autonomous teams that experiment, learn, and deliver at speed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across functions, locations, and time zones&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend expertise in RUST&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in decentralized identity solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building systems with advanced cryptography requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can you expect from us:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited vacation policy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within international environment &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning Budget &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile Allowance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Allowance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Urban Sport Membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sounds like you? Apply now!  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe in hiring different and diverse talent and providing a safe space where everyone can share their views without fear, where differences are celebrated, and where no one is left out. Inclusive cultures are the foundation for collaboration and innovation within our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this position, you confirm that you have read and understood &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;, and consent to the collection, use, and disclosure of your personal data for recruitment purposes, as described in the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is the company behind Grafana Cloud, the fully managed observability platform trusted by more than 10,000 organizations to ensure reliability, resolve incidents faster, and optimize telemetry at scale. Built on open source and open standards and designed for interoperability across any stack, Grafana Cloud brings AI to observability and observability to AI, giving teams (and their agents) unified visibility so they can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data, wherever it lives, and move at the speed of their ambitions. Customers, including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce, rely on Grafana Labs. We are a 100% remote company with team members across 40+ countries, backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote opportunity and we would be interested in applicants based in Spain, Ireland, Germany, the UK or Sweden at this time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grafana Observability builds end-to-end observability that spans application, infrastructure, database, browser, and mobile. Our Mobile Observability initiative gives mobile developers first-class instrumentation SDKs that capture traces, metrics, logs, crashes, and user sessions. Our solutions aim to be tightly integrated with OpenTelemetry and Grafana Cloud. We’re building high-performance, low-overhead SDKs that make it easy for teams to connect mobile signals to backend and infra telemetry for true full-stack visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value open standards, great developer experience, and doing the hard engineering needed to ship reliable software at scale. You may not meet every requirement below. If this role excites you, please raise your hand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve mobile instrumentation SDKs for iOS (Swift / Obj-C), prioritizing performance, stability, and a great developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and ship SDK features such as session tracking, crash reporting, sampling strategies, automatic context propagation, and OpenTelemetry integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own projects end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break large, ambiguous problems into incremental deliverables: design modular solutions, ship MVPs, gather feedback, iterate quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure quality: automated tests, CI, documentation, and smooth, backwards-compatible upgrade paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with backend, frontend, product, and solutions engineering to ensure cohesive end-to-end observability workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with the open-source community: review PRs, discuss design proposals, and help guide external contributors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor teammates, participate in technical design discussions and help shape the mobile observability roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a motivated self-starter with a bias toward action and the ability to run with poorly defined scopes. You can operate autonomously while being highly collaborative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong mobile engineering experience: with iOS (Swift/Obj-C) and, optionally, Android (Kotlin/Java).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building or maintaining mobile SDKs, platform libraries, or other developer-facing platform code used by external developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with performance-sensitive code (startup time, memory, network efficiency) and making pragmatic tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with OpenTelemetry (instrumentation, SDKs, collectors) or experience contributing to/maintaining OTel SDKs or similar telemetry libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a fully remote, globally distributed team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coachable, customer-focused, and passionate about developer experience, you can do more than code: you write docs, mentor others, and shape roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic and comfortable navigating ambiguity: you prioritize progress over perfection and iterate quickly based on feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to OpenTelemetry, crash reporting libraries, or other observability OSS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cross-platform frameworks (React Native, Flutter) or building native bindings/bridges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mobile security, privacy, or platform integration challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work on crash aggregation, session replay, or sampling for mobile telemetry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Germany, the compensation range for this role is €97,000 - €121,000. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed throughout the interview process. All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Compensation ranges are country specific. If you are applying for this role from a different location than listed above, your recruiter will discuss your specific market’s defined pay range &amp;amp; benefits at the beginning of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Thrive at Grafana Labs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;100% Remote, Global Culture -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;As a remote-only company, we bring together talent from around the world, united by a culture of collaboration and shared purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling Organization&lt;/strong&gt; – Tackle meaningful work in a high-growth, ever-evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Communication&lt;/strong&gt; – Expect open decision-making and regular company-wide updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation-Driven&lt;/strong&gt; – Autonomy and support to ship great work and try new things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Source Roots&lt;/strong&gt; – Built on community-driven values that shape how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowered Teams&lt;/strong&gt; – High trust, low ego culture that values outcomes over optics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth Pathways&lt;/strong&gt; – Defined opportunities to grow and develop your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Approachable Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; – Transparent execs who are involved, visible, and human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate People&lt;/strong&gt; – Join a team of smart, supportive folks who care deeply about what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person onboarding &lt;/strong&gt;- We want you to thrive from day 1 with your fellow new ‘Grafanistas’ to learn all about what we do and how we do it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance is Key&lt;/strong&gt; - We operate a global annual leave policy of 30 days per annum. 3 days of your annual leave entitlement are reserved for Grafana Shutdown Days to allow the team to really disconnect. &lt;em&gt;*We will comply with local legislation where applicable.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Grafana Labs is an equal opportunities employer. We welcome applications from everyone regardless of race, colour, nationality, origin, caste, sex, gender reassignment identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, religion or belief, disability, veteran status, genetic information, pregnancy, maternity, marital, family or carer status, or any other characteristic which is protected by local law. We believe that equality and diversity build a strong organisation, and we work hard to ensure that is the foundation of our organisation as we grow.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Grafana Labs may utilize AI tools in its recruitment process to assist in matching information provided in CVs to job postings. The recruitment team will continue to review inbound CVs manually to identify alignment with current openings.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information about how your personal data is used once you’ve applied to a job, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/legal/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
