&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Why Verifone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more than 40 years Verifone has established a remarkable record of leadership in the electronic payment technology industry. Verifone has one of the leading electronic payment solutions brands and is one of the largest providers of electronic payment systems worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone has a diverse, dynamic and fast paced work environment in which employees are focused on results and have opportunities to excel. We take pride in the fact that we work with leading retailers, merchants, banks, and third party partners to invent and deliver innovative payments solution around the world. We strive for excellence in our products and services, and are obsessed with customer happiness. Across the globe, Verifone employees are leading the payments industry through experience, innovation, and an ambitious spirit. Whether it’s developing the next platform of secure payment systems or searching for new ways to bring electronic payments to new markets, the team at Verifone is dedicated to the success of our customers, partners and investors. It is this passion for innovation that drives each one of our employees for personal and professional success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is proudly an in-office work culture as we see immense benefits to career development and business results from our colleagues being physically co-located. Currently,&amp;nbsp;we do allow a hybrid work schedule but we regularly revisit our attendance policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Exciting About The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role places you at the centre of Verifone’s payment application strategy for the DACH region. You will shape the terminal application stack that powers one of Europe’s most complex and competitive payment markets — across attended, unattended, SmartPOS, SoftPOS, gateway, and 3rd Party App environments. You will influence product direction across all form factors, drive girocard and next‑generation initiatives like Victa, and own a horizontal product portfolio that touches every merchant segment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For candidates who want broad ownership, strategic impact, and visibility across engineering, sales, and market leadership, this is one of the most influential product roles in the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BHE Poseidon App roadmap &amp;amp; Book of Work&lt;/strong&gt;: End-to-end release planning and prioritisation across the DACH product portfolio (Victa series, NEO 2, Engage (until EOL) and future upcoming products) and the software attached to it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Payment methods&lt;/strong&gt;: Girocard (DK), ICS (International card Schemes, ELV/GLV, APMs, cashback, instalments, in future Wero (EPI) and Digital Euro&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer variants&lt;/strong&gt;: Like enterprise-specific builds. You know why the same terminal ships six different application variants — and can defend or consolidate that on the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estate &amp;amp; terminal management&lt;/strong&gt;: VHQ 2.0 rollout and adoption, remote update, key management, and certificate management for Verifone and our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certification pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;: PCI-PTS, P2PE vs non-P2PE, GBIC, DC POS / TA, DK certification cycles — you own the sequencing (not the certification itself) so the sales pipeline never stalls on a missing certificate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scheme &amp;amp; regulator alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: Deutsche Kreditwirtschaft (DK), EURO Kartensysteme, Bundesbank/BaFin adjacencies, and equivalent bodies for AT and CH (SIX / EP2).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales &amp;amp; Ops alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner to DACH Region management and country sales on Book of Work, feature commitments, and customer escalations — from Partner conferences to enterprise merchants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering &amp;amp; ADC partnership&lt;/strong&gt;: Tight collaboration with the Poseidon Engineering, and Hardware teams on release readiness, hardware supply topics (spares, EOL), and new form factors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hardware aspects&lt;/strong&gt;: Cover the relevant workstreams to make a hardware product sellable in the DACH region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Skills and Experience We Desire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or Business fluent German language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management&amp;nbsp;in the DACH/EU payments space — terminal vendor, PSP, acquiring, or network operator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad payments fluency: girocard, international card schemes, SoftPOS, APMs, ELV/SEPA — and how a terminal management system (VHQ or equivalent) ties the estate together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical foundation: ZVT-H / PSDK / SDI / EP2, EMV kernel, PCI-PTS, P2PE, PSD2 SCA. You do not need to code, but you read Engineering quotes and certification reports on your own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Book of Work discipline: comfortable owning a multi-product, multi-customer release matrix and forcing prioritisation trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regulatory instinct: BaFin/ZAG context, DK/GBIC, ZAIT — you know when a feature change triggers an approval process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Our Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Verifone is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6 content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Residency in Germany is required. This role is currently fully remote&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At JFrog, we’re reinventing DevOps to help the world’s greatest companies innovate -- and we want you along for the ride. This is a special place with a unique combination of brilliance, spirit and just all-around great people. Here, if you’re willing to do more, your career can take off. And since software plays a central role in everyone’s lives, you’ll be part of an important mission. Thousands of customers, including the majority of the Fortune 100, trust JFrog to manage, accelerate, and secure their software delivery from code to production -- a concept we call “liquid software.” Wouldn&#39;t it be amazing if you could join us in our journey?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Solutions Engineer to be on the front lines, working closely with our strategic customers and prospects, guiding them on how to build robust and secured business critical DevOps and software development processes in the age of agentic development. You will work with our Sales, Product &amp;amp; Engineering teams to help customers understand the value of JFrog solutions from a technical and business perspective. If you love working with brilliant people, being part of an energetic team and changing the world of software, you might be the perfect Frog to join our team!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Senior Solutions Engineer at JFrog you will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with customers to ensure their success in their DevOps and DevSecOps&amp;nbsp; journey leveraging the JFrog Platform&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support JFrog&#39;s Technical Selling motion and significantly contribute to the customer journey to build technical win and championship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Showcase JFrog’s technology and success in events and conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence the features and roadmap of JFrog products based on customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with the latest technology trends related to the DevOps and DevSecOps landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To be a Senior Solution Engineer at JFrog you need...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years experience in Technical Sales or Sales Engineering positions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building relationships with customers’ champions and senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD, git integrations and&amp;nbsp; build tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AppSec tools (part or all) such as: SCA / SAST / SBOM Management / Container Security&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build software pipelines with various DevOps tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with cloud infrastructures - AWS / Azure / GCP - Mandatory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with agentic development workflows and understanding of related technical elements: LLMs, MCPs, skills and prompts - is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in software development role - is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native German speaker
&lt;div class=&quot;mt-3 w-full empty:hidden&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;text-center&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale, unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data, securing and protecting private information more effectively, Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you looking to make a real impact and play a meaningful role in the growth of our company?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic is seeking a Value Engineer based in Germany to support our customers in the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now is an exciting time to join Elastic; you&#39;ll be joining at a pivotal stage where your expertise will be instrumental in building the foundations for our future success with our strategic clients. Your role is crucial in ensuring our clients unlock the full business impacts of Elastic, driving value and fostering long-term partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking individuals who thrive in dynamic environments, have a passion for customer excellence, delivering exceptional outcomes, and are ready to collaborate with a team of high-performing sales professionals. If you have experience working as a Value Engineer, Management Consultant, or a related customer facing role, we would love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with account teams to identify and execute value delivery strategies for key accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with stakeholders to identify, understand, and quantify their unique business challenges. Translate Elastic’s value proposition and technical capabilities into clear economic benefits aligned with their corporate goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead business value reviews / business cases: Effectively communicate the realized value and potential economic benefits of new opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct thorough analysis of customer workflows and processes, identifying opportunities for optimization and increased efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and deliver boardroom-quality, executive documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with product and engineering teams to tailor solutions to meet the specific needs of Elastic’s customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance on best practices and innovative approaches to maximize the value of Elastic solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a subject matter expert on our solutions with our customers, remaining informed about industry trends and advancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct training and workshops with Elastic teammates to increase the quality of their discovery and their understanding of business value &amp;amp; customer excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build the future of the value engineering practice at Elastic: contribute to the development of best practices and tools for an enhanced value based selling adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in value engineering, management consulting, solution architecture, or a related customer-facing role within the software or consulting industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge and experience in value-based-selling methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in building and briefing business cases to executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in progressing on the technical side of selling Elastic (systems, process, people from a CTO perspective).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in identifying and prioritizing use cases, implementing improvement measures and becoming a change agent for Elastic customers by establishing a value delivery model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to project manage across multiple workstreams, including defining scope, expectations, timelines and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills; ability to act decisively with ambiguous guidance and circumstances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Germany, with business-fluent German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel to meet clients is required (approximately 2x/month).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cloud infrastructure software (Data+AI, Observability, Security).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation for this role is in the form of base salary plus a variable component, that together comprise the On-Target Earnings (OTE). On-Target Earnings (OTE) are based on a 75/25 pay mix (base salary / target variable).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation for this role is in the form of base salary plus a variable component.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Elastic, our compensation philosophy aims to provide fair, competitive and transparent remuneration. Salary ranges are established based on a combination of external market benchmarks, internal pay equity considerations, and the responsibilities and complexity associated with each role. This approach helps ensure consistency across comparable roles while remaining competitive within the relevant labour markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The final compensation offered within the applicable range will be determined based on several objective factors, including relevant professional experience, level of skills and expertise, alignment with the role requirements, and the overall scope and complexity of the position.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The typical starting On-Target Earnings range (Base Salary + Variable) for this role is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€105.100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€166.200 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ----- ----- class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Security Specialist Solutions Architect, you will bring deep expertise in SIEM solutions, security technologies, and consultative selling to support customers in securing their data and infrastructure. You will leverage your knowledge of vendor ecosystems, security architectures, and operational processes to help customers solve complex challenges, enhance incident response, and build modern, scalable security solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect next-generation security solutions: Design and implement cutting-edge solutions utilizing Elastic&#39;s latest advancements in AI, to help improve incident response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Harness the power of the Elastic Security Solution to enable organizations to achieve their use case requirements and improve overall operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver compelling proof-of-value (POV) projects: Showcase the value of Elastic Security’s detection, AI, and Incident Response capabilities, demonstrating the potential to improve the analyst experience and shorten the time it takes for an analyst to make an informed decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a thought leader and evangelize our vision: Share your expertise through presentations, blog posts, and other channels, positioning Elastic as the leader in SIEM and Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster collaboration and knowledge sharing: Cultivate a collaborative environment within the Solutions Architecture team and across departments, promoting knowledge sharing and driving continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of the curve: Continuously learn and explore the ever-evolving landscapes of SIEM and Analytics and related technologies, ensuring our solutions are always at the forefront of innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in enterprise PreSales.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with SIEM platforms and vendor solutions in enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of AI and its impact on SIEM and Analytics solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German &amp;amp; English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of SOC workflows, processes, and operational challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of a wide range of security solutions, the type of data they produce and build content to satisfy Use Case Requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background that includes forensic analysis, troubleshooting, and threat mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Behavioral Analytics, and Machine Learning techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and thrive in fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in consultative selling, RFI/RFP responses, and customer presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, able to engage both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative spirit and a passion for sharing knowledge and expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unwavering commitment to continuous learning and staying ahead of the curve in technology and emerging trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certifications such as CISSP, CEH, or GIAC are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel 30-50% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation for this role is in the form of base salary plus a variable component.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Elastic, our compensation philosophy aims to provide fair, competitive and transparent remuneration. Salary ranges are established based on a combination of external market benchmarks, internal pay equity considerations, and the responsibilities and complexity associated with each role. This approach helps ensure consistency across comparable roles while remaining competitive within the relevant labour markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The final compensation offered within the applicable range will be determined based on several objective factors, including relevant professional experience, level of skills and expertise, alignment with the role requirements, and the overall scope and complexity of the position.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The typical starting On-Target Earnings range (Base Salary + Variable) for this role is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€105.100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€166.200 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ----- ----- class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Staffbase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Employee Experience Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Our&lt;strong&gt; industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels&lt;/strong&gt; - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.&lt;br&gt;We are proud to be a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Unicorn&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Senior Fullstack Engineer to join a newly formed team at Staffbase that builds custom solutions — extending the functionality and capabilities of our award-winning employee communications platform to meet real customer needs. You’ll own solutions from beginning to end: shaping use cases together with stakeholders, building them across the stack, and validating them with the people who use them. You’ll also help bring structure to a growing team of mid-level engineers and mentor them along the way. We’re looking for empathetic, motivated team players who are driven by ownership and growth. Let’s talk!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As part of our tech stack, we use: &lt;/strong&gt;React.js, TypeScript, JavaScript, Node.js, Kotlin, Go, Java, MongoDB, REST APIs &amp;amp; SDKs, Docker, Terraform, Selenium and Cypress, to name a few.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Working with skilled and like-minded professionals in a team that values diversity and inclusivity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We aim to create a flexible and agile work environment that promotes the well-being and work-life balance of our employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We believe that team events during working hours play a vital role in building an exceptionally effective team, and we encourage them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We are enthusiastic about technology and committed to using it to improve the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;We follow the “You build it, you run it” approach and take pride in it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll join a newly formed team dedicated to building custom solutions that extend the Staffbase platform for our enterprise customers. We turn specific customer needs into reliable, scalable extensions — widgets, plugins, and integrations — that make our product work exactly the way each customer needs it to.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Because the team is new, there’s real room to shape how we work: to set engineering standards, bring structure to our processes, and grow together. That’s where you come in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Own the development of custom solutions end-to-end — from technical design through implementation, testing, and release&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with stakeholders (customers, consultants, and internal teams) to define and detail use cases before development, then validate solutions and gather feedback afterward&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Build across the stack: customer-facing UI in React and TypeScript, backend services, and integrations with Staffbase and third-party APIs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Mentor mid-level engineers and help bring structure, engineering standards, and good practices to a newly formed team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Work in a cross-functional, agile setup and produce high-quality, well-tested code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Give and receive valuable feedback in our code review process, and continuously learn and share knowledge with your peers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Work iteratively — pushing code frequently, keeping a healthy CI/CD pipeline, and automating where it helps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Solid professional experience (typically 5+ years) as a fullstack developer, including working within engineering teams and owning solutions from concept to delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Strong frontend skills with React.js, TypeScript, and JavaScript, paired with solid backend experience (e.g. Kotlin, Java, or Node.js)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Confidence working with REST APIs and SDKs, and integrating with external systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Experience mentoring or guiding less-experienced developers, and a knack for bringing structure to how a team works&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort working directly with stakeholders — you can translate business needs into technical solutions and validate them afterward&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;A strong focus on quality, clean code, testing, and continuous learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Fluent written and spoken English and German — both are required, as you’ll work closely with German-speaking stakeholders and customers in the region&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;A self-starter who works well both independently and as part of a team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;You understand and appreciate diversity and inclusivity in the workplace&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with Go, MongoDB, Docker, Kubernetes, GitHub Actions, Terraform, Prometheus or Grafana&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;A background in professional services, consulting, or building custom, customer-facing solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Enterprise integration concepts such as SSO, SAML, OIDC, or SCIM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;A good understanding of REST and microservices architecture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/em&gt; - we offer attractive salary packages including LTIP (unit-based Long Term Incentive Plan)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &lt;/em&gt;- we offer flexible working time models and the option of hybrid work, and support this with a yearly flex work allowance of €1560&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recharge&lt;/em&gt; - with 31 vacation days annually (incl. one floating holiday), plus pro rata fully paid Fridays off during August&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;we offer offering a company pension scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Volunteers Day&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;- you’ll get one day off per year for supporting a social project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://imgur.com/a/kIbq0q5&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;As Supply Chain Manager, you will own, drive, and lead the end-to-end supply chain for Auterion products. This is a hands-on leadership role combining operational execution, people leadership, and strategic development of a resilient, scalable, and efficient supply chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead and develop the supply chain team while working closely with Engineering, Procurement, Production, Logistics, Sales, Finance, and external partners. You will be the central point of ownership for supply chain performance, proactively identifying risks, solving issues, and driving improvements that support business growth and customer satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end supply chain for Auterion products, including supply planning, production scheduling, logistics, inventory, and order fulfilment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop, and grow the supply chain team, setting clear priorities, accountability, and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive day-to-day execution and supply availability, ensuring materials, production requirements, shipments, inventory, and customer orders are managed accurately and on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary point of escalation for supply disruptions, shortages, production constraints, and other supply chain risks, driving hands-on resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Procurement, suppliers, and logistics partners to improve delivery performance, lead times, reliability, capacity, quality, and resilience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement across supply chain processes, systems, data, and ways of working, including ERP and NetSuite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and monitor supply chain KPIs, using data to identify issues, drive corrective action, and provide clear recommendations to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable processes and operating models, including SOPs, planning processes, and best practices to support business growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional initiatives including new product introductions, engineering changes, supplier transitions, and operational readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop supply chain strategy and resilience, including contingency planning, alternative sourcing, and critical-component strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the continued growth of the function through hiring, coaching, capability development, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in supply chain, procurement, logistics, planning, operations, or a related field, ideally in technology, hardware, aerospace, robotics, or manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience owning and improving end-to-end supply chain processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading, mentoring, or developing people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of supply planning, procurement, inventory, production planning, logistics, and fulfilment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage risks, disruptions, shortages, and escalations in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and data-driven decision-making skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ERP systems, ideally NetSuite, and strong Excel/spreadsheet skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and tracking KPIs and operational performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and process improvement skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills across technical, operational, commercial, and leadership teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, pragmatic, proactive, and comfortable with autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident user of Google Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English required; German is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we build a global platform for drones and autonomous robots. In the growing market of autonomous vehicles, we connect high-end software and hardware. Our Munich-based defense engineering team develops the technologies that form the foundation of current and future drone products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Electronics Engineer, you will be a member of our interdisciplinary hardware engineering team, driving the design and development of cutting-edge electronics for our next-generation drone platforms. You’ll take ownership of electronic modules such as flight controllers, sensors, and vision systems, leading PCB development from concept to mass production.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of a cross-functional team, you will develop advanced systems such as interceptor and reconnaissance drones with integrated visual navigation, as well as quadcopters for defense applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, prototype, and validate advanced avionics PCBs, sensors, and electronic modules for drone platforms, driving concepts from initial ideation through detailed design and manufacturing readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute comprehensive PCB and product verification activities, including test strategy definition, execution, and documentation; perform electrical and mechanical validation such as EMI/EMC compliance testing, thermal cycling, mechanical shock testing, and HALT analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce and maintain technical documentation, including design concepts, schematics and CAD drawings, bills of materials (BOMs), assembly instructions, and repair manuals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with test engineering, manufacturing, and production teams to ensure smooth transition of hardware designs from development to volume production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product management and customer success teams to align system architecture and interfaces, define electronics requirements, and incorporate feedback from field deployments into design improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor junior engineers to achieve technical excellence and develop best practices within the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Electrical or Electronics Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in PCB design and electronic product development, including prototyping, layout, and driving products from concept through production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven expertise in high-density and mixed-signal PCB design, with broad understanding of signal and power integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with PCB verification and testing processes, covering signal integrity analysis and EMC troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Altium Designer is highly desirable&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with high power applications, ESCs and lithium batteries is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, solution-oriented mindset with a proactive approach to problem-solving and the ability to address technical challenges independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating in cross-functional hardware/software teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving, communication (English), and project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

Creatio is an AI CRM and workflow platform where people and AI agents work together — with no limits on users,&nbsp; agents, or scale.&nbsp;We help midsize and large organizations run customer workflows in the AI era. Headquartered in&nbsp; Boston, MA, with a global team and a large ecosystem of partners, Creatio serves thousands of customers in over 100&nbsp; countries and automates tens of millions of workflows daily. Genuine care for our clients and partners is at the heart of our DNA.&nbsp;We’re proud to be recognized by top industry analysts as a&nbsp;Leader and Strong Performer in multiple Gartner and Forrester reports.&nbsp;In 2025, Creatio was named to Inc.’s Best Workplaces list,&nbsp;recognizing our commitment to employee wellbeing and a strong workplace culture.Who We’re Looking For:We are seeking a passionate, proactive, and results-driven Account Executive, Enterprise who is excited to contribute to a fast-growing and innovative company. The ideal candidate is someone who thrives in a dynamic environment, embraces challenges as opportunities, and is motivated to bring fresh ideas to the table.You should be a strong team player with excellent communication skills, eager to learn and grow, and ready to make an impact from day one. Most importantly, we’re looking for individuals who share our values, believe in collaboration, and want to be part of a workplace where creativity, accountability, and ambition are celebrated.The role is based in Munich, Germany.&nbsp;Responsibilities:Manage the end-to-end enterprise sales process and resources to create and execute winning solution sales strategies.Focus on new logo acquisition and manage relationships with the existing accounts to identify opportunities for cross and up-sales.Deliver against revenue targets and all key performance metrics.Generate new business opportunities on an assigned territory, manage pipeline, opportunities, forecasting, and other items related to a normal outside sales function.Establish relationships with VP/C-level buyers (Business and IT).Develop and orchestrate sales presentations and product demonstrations.Ability to work with all customer functions, including executive-level personnel, various customer stakeholders, architecture, operations, design, vendor management, innovation, sourcing, and customer procurement.Requirements:Minimum 5+ years of experience working within enterprise SaaS platform sales into large Enterprises.Proven track record of meeting quarterly and annual targets.Deep understanding of executive-level Enterprise and/or Global Account sales and methodologies.Outstanding organizational, excellent communication and interpersonal skills, and an ability to build and maintain strong, lasting business relationships with clients.Ability to identify and focus on the highest-revenue potential clients.Understand key market and industry trends and dynamics.Strong personal network within the region.Driven, highly motivated, and passionate about sales.Self-motivated, result-driven, with high energy and an engaging level of enthusiasm.Fluent in German and English — both verbal and written.Experience with CRM/BPM software space is a plus.What you should expect from us:Growth &amp; Development: Clear career paths, mentorship opportunities, and access to continuous learning to help you reach your full potential.Flexibility &amp; Well-Being: We provide flexible work arrangements and initiatives that empower you to manage your schedule effectively, stay productive, and thrive both personally and professionally.Recognition &amp; Impact: A culture that celebrates achievements, values your ideas, and empowers you to make real contributions from day one.Innovative Culture: Be part of a company that embraces new ideas, modern technologies, and bold thinking to stay ahead of the curve.Benefits &amp; Rewards Package: We provide competitive compensation and benefits designed to support you and your family. Our rewards approach goes beyond salary, recognizing your contributions and commitment. The exact package may vary depending on your country of residence and employment type.Responsibilities
