&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience building executive-level champions and leading cross-functional teams to execute against a defined account strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
